{"root":"kaget","ipa":"/kaɡət/","core":"指因突发事件而感到吃惊、受惊或吓一跳，通常带有生理上的瞬间反应。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/kaɡət/","zh":"吃惊的，受惊的","phrases":[{"t":"kaget setengah mati","zh":"吓得半死"},{"t":"terkejut kaget","zh":"大吃一惊"},{"t":"jangan kaget","zh":"别吃惊"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya kaget mendengar berita itu.","zh":"听到那个消息我吓了一跳。"},{"t":"Dia kaget melihat ada ular di depannya.","zh":"他看到面前有条蛇，吓了一跳。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"kaget","ipa":"/kaɡət/","zh":"吃惊的","phrase":{"t":"kaget sekali","zh":"非常吃惊"},"example":{"t":"Wajahnya tampak kaget.","zh":"他的表情看起来很吃惊。"}},{"w":"terkaget-kaget","ipa":"/tərkaɡət kaɡət/","zh":"不断地受惊，一惊一乍","phrase":{"t":"selalu terkaget-kaget","zh":"总是大惊小怪"},"example":{"t":"Anak itu terkaget-kaget mendengar suara petir.","zh":"那孩子听到雷声吓得一惊一乍的。"}},{"w":"mengagetkan","ipa":"/məŋaɡətkan/","zh":"使人吃惊的，令人震惊的","phrase":{"t":"berita mengagetkan","zh":"令人震惊的消息"},"example":{"t":"Kejadian itu sangat mengagetkan warga.","zh":"那件事让居民们感到非常震惊。"}},{"w":"terkaget","ipa":"/tərkaɡət/","zh":"突然受惊的","phrase":{"t":"terkaget mendengar suara","zh":"听到声音而受惊"},"example":{"t":"Dia terkaget saat pintu tiba-tiba terbuka.","zh":"门突然打开时，他吓了一跳。"}}],"derSlugs":["kaget","terkaget-kaget","mengagetkan","terkaget"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:45:42.922Z","src":"base"}